    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35700" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνικμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰκμάς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with wet in it, humid,</i>
			
